<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22088" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεωργ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ, ἔργον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tilling the ground</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοίδιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1036
				</span></i>
			; <i>fertilizing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νεῖλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					13.39
				</span></i>
			:—as Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεωργός, ὁ</span>,
			<i>husbandman</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				296
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				276b
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ γ.</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ μισθαρνοῦντες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1296b28
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ.</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δεσπότης τοῦ χωρίου</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1100
			</span></i>; so of vine-dressers, gardeners, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				178d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ὄχλος</span>
			<i>the peasantry</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				10.53
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. βίος</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				589
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδρων ὧν γ. αἵδε αἱ χεῖρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					2.26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
